## report-task-complete.soar -- thor-soar: 1 proposal, 1 application.

## Propose report-task-complete.
sp {thor-soar*propose*report-task-complete
    :default
   (state <s> ^desireds <desireds>
              ^success <desireds>
              ^superstate.operator <ss-operator>)
   (<ss-operator> ^effect-desireds <desireds>
                  ^super-desired.completed-task <task>)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <operator> + !)
   (<operator> ^name report-task-complete
               ^task <task>)
}

## Apply report-task-complete -> sets completed-task.
## This flag will cause the desired to be achieved
sp {thor-soar*apply*report-task-complete
    :default
   (state <s> ^operator <operator>
              ^top-state.world <world>)
   (<operator> ^name report-task-complete
               ^task <task>)
   (<world> ^anchored-world true)
-->
   (<world> ^completed-task <task>)
}
